<html lang='en'>
  <head>
    <meta charset='utf-8' />
    <meta name='viewport' content='width=device-width, initial-scale=1' />
    <title>Password reset</title>
  </head>
  <body>
    <h1>Reset your password</h1>
    <p>Hello {{email}},</p>
    <p>Use this one-time token to verify your password reset request:</p>
    <p><code>{{token}}</code></p>
    <p>
      Submit the token to
      <code>POST /api/v1/auth/verify/forgot-password</code>, then use it with
      <code>POST /api/v1/auth/reset-password</code>
      and your new password.
    </p>
    <p>This token expires in
      {{expiresIn}}. If you did not request a reset, ignore this email.</p>
  </body>
</html>